WEBVTT

00:01:29.585 --> 00:01:31.087
Once you have that all prepped,

00:01:31.087 --> 00:01:33.047
please turn to somebody next to you.

00:01:33.089 --> 00:01:35.967
Ideally, somebody you don't know.

00:01:37.510 --> 00:01:39.637
Yeah, we're doing this, people,

00:01:39.679 --> 00:01:40.930
we're doing this.

00:01:40.972 --> 00:01:42.306
(Laughs)

00:01:42.974 --> 00:01:44.100
Great.

00:01:44.517 --> 00:01:46.018
Everybody find a partner?

00:01:46.060 --> 00:01:47.478
OK, now look back at me.

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:49.397
OK, now look back at me.

00:01:49.856 --> 00:01:54.110
You are going to draw each other, OK?

00:01:54.152 --> 00:01:56.070
No, no, no, no, wait, wait, wait, wait.

00:01:56.112 --> 00:01:58.823
I promise this is not
about doing a good drawing, OK?

00:01:58.865 --> 00:02:00.449
That's not what we're doing here,